\ * Source disassembly & documentation by Kieran Connell, November 2015
\ * Initial disassembly created using BeebDis v??? by Phill Harvey-Smith
\ * Verified to compile using BeebAsm v??? by Rich Talbot-Watkins
\ *
\ * Notes
\ * Original $.THRUST3 executable had to first be decrypted -> (Thrust4)
\ * Relocated from load address $1A00 to executation address $A60 -> (Thrust5)
\ * Relocation code modified slightly as no longer encrypted -> (Thrust6)
\ * Source documented and annotated --> (Thrust7)
\ *****************************************************************************


